! ===========================================================================
!  FABRIC COLLECT - IOS 15.2 switches (2960 / 2960C)
!  Targets: Annex II Roof, Chancery 2960, RES 4 Relay (and any 2960-class)
!  READ ONLY. No config mode, no write, no clear, no shut. Safe to paste.
!  HOW: enable session logging in MobaXterm, ensure you are at the # prompt,
!       paste this whole block. It self-runs. Repeat on each IOS-15 switch.
! ===========================================================================
terminal length 0
terminal exec prompt timestamp
!
! ---- identity / clock ----
show clock detail
show version | include uptime|RELEASE|System image|ID
show inventory
!
! ---- SPANNING TREE (the core of the loop question) ----
! Who is root for VLAN 17, and which local port reaches it:
show spanning-tree vlan 17
show spanning-tree vlan 17 detail
! Root + bridge ID + topology-change counters across all VLANs at a glance:
show spanning-tree summary
! Any ports blocking (a blocked port = STP is actively breaking a loop):
show spanning-tree blockedports
! Inconsistent ports (root-guard/loop-guard/BPDU events):
show spanning-tree inconsistentports
! Detailed TCN history per VLAN17 interface (last change + count):
show spanning-tree vlan 17 detail | include occurr|from|topology|Port|ROOT|designated
!
! ---- TRUNKS / VLAN reach (which links carry VLAN 17) ----
show interfaces trunk
show vlan brief | include ^17 |WAVES
!
! ---- ARP (who is alive on the mesh subnet 172.17.9.x) ----
show ip arp | include 172.17.9
show ip arp summary
! Look for duplicate or incomplete entries:
show ip arp | include Incomplete
!
! ---- MAC table (where each node physically lands) ----
show mac address-table dynamic vlan 17
show mac address-table count
! Track the two MACs of interest (.7 mgmt vs the Fa0/1 occupant):
show mac address-table address 0018.a601.2290
show mac address-table address 0018.a6e0.bf79
! MAC aging (short aging can churn a marginal node off/on):
show mac address-table aging-time
!
! ---- INTERFACE HEALTH on VLAN17 uplinks/backbone ----
show interfaces status
show interfaces counters errors
! Per-interface drops/CRC/resets (catches a dirty trunk that desyncs STP):
show interfaces | include line protocol|CRC|input errors|output errors|resets|reliability
!
! ---- CDP/LLDP neighbor map (build the real topology) ----
show cdp neighbors detail | include Device ID|IP address|Interface|Platform
show lldp neighbors detail | include System Name|Local Intf|Port id|Management
!
! ---- LOG scan for the smoking guns ----
show logging | include MACFLAP|SW_MATM|MAC_MOVE
show logging | include SPANTREE|ROOTGUARD|LOOPGUARD|BPDUGUARD
show logging | include LINK-3|LINEPROTO-5|DUPLEX|errdisable
show logging | include 172.17.9.7|172.17.9.135|DUP
!
terminal no exec prompt timestamp
! ===========================================================================
!  END IOS-15 COLLECT
! ===========================================================================
